@startuml
title UML sequence behaviour — Read the OpenAPI document
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 12
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam ArrowColor #344054
skinparam rectangle {
  BorderColor #344054
  FontColor #101828
}
skinparam package {
  BorderColor #667085
  FontColor #101828
  BackgroundColor #F9FAFB
}
participant "Consuming product" as product
box "Backend — Keryx API application" #D1FADF
  participant "OpenAPI document v1" as doc
  participant "ErrorCodesOperationTransformer" as trans
  participant "Consumer controllers" as ctrls
end box
product -> doc : GET /openapi/v1.json (authentication TO SUPPLY)
doc -> ctrls : Enumerate endpoints in the v1 group
ctrls --> doc : Routes, parameters, response types
loop each /v1 operation
  doc -> trans : Transform operation
  trans -> trans : Apply L2-025 parameter bounds (limit 1..100, q 2..60, range 366 days)
  trans -> trans : Add ProblemDetails responses with each ProducesErrorCode code
  trans --> doc : Enriched operation
end
doc --> product : 200 OpenAPI JSON describing every /v1 endpoint, parameter, body and error code
@enduml
